<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<templates xml:space="preserve">

    <t t-name="al_construction_planner.ScheduleReport">
        <div class="o_action o_cp_schedule_report d-flex flex-column h-100">
            <div class="o_cp_toolbar d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 border-bottom">
                <select class="form-select form-select-sm w-auto o_cp_sr_project" t-on-change="this.onProjectChange"
                        aria-label="Obra">
                    <t t-foreach="this.state.projects" t-as="project" t-key="project.id">
                        <option t-att-value="project.id" t-att-selected="project.id === this.state.projectId"
                                t-out="project.name"/>
                    </t>
                </select>
                <div class="btn-group btn-group-sm" role="group" aria-label="Escenario">
                    <button class="btn o_cp_sr_plan" t-att-class="this.state.scenario === 'plan' ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-secondary'"
                            t-on-click="() => this.setScenario('plan')">Previsto</button>
                    <button class="btn o_cp_sr_real" t-att-class="this.state.scenario === 'real' ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-secondary'"
                            t-on-click="() => this.setScenario('real')">Real</button>
                </div>
                <span t-if="this.state.data?.plan_name" class="small text-muted">
                    Plan de recursos <t t-out="this.state.data.plan_name"/>
                </span>
                <div class="ms-auto d-flex gap-2">
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" t-on-click="this.load" t-att-disabled="this.state.loading">
                        <i class="oi me-1" data-icon="refresh"/>Actualizar
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary o_cp_sr_analysis" t-on-click="this.openAnalysis"
                            t-att-disabled="!this.state.projectId">
                        <i class="oi me-1" data-icon="table_chart"/>Pivote y gráfico
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-primary o_cp_sr_export" t-on-click="this.exportXlsx"
                            t-att-disabled="!this.rows.length">
                        <i class="oi me-1" data-icon="table_chart"/>Exportar a Excel
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="o_cp_sr_body flex-grow-1 overflow-auto px-3 py-2">
                <t t-if="!this.state.projectId">
                    <div class="o_view_nocontent">
                        <div class="o_nocontent_help">
                            <p class="o_view_nocontent_empty_folder">Ninguna obra tiene plan de recursos</p>
                            <p>El cronograma valorizado sale del plan de la obra, sus entregas, valorizaciones,
                               facturas y cobros.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </t>
                <t t-elif="this.state.data">
                    <div class="o_cp_sr_kpis d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi">
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_value" t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.cost)"/>
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_label">Costo <t t-out="this.state.scenario === 'plan' ? 'del plan' : 'ejecutado'"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi">
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_value" t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.revenue)"/>
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_label"><t t-out="this.state.scenario === 'plan' ? 'Precio del contrato' : 'Ingreso devengado'"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi">
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_value" t-att-class="this.totals.margin &lt; 0 ? 'text-danger' : ''"
                                 t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.margin)"/>
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_label">Margen <t t-out="this.state.scenario === 'plan' ? 'al cierre' : 'a la fecha'"/></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi">
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_value" t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.collection_total)"/>
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_label">Cobrado con el fondo de garantía</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi" t-if="this.totals.max_gap_week">
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_value" t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.max_gap)"/>
                            <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi_label">Mayor brecha costo − cobrado</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="o_cp_sr_kpi text-muted small align-self-center">
                            Símbolo: <t t-out="this.state.data.currency_symbol"/>. La brecha usa el costo devengado,
                            que no es lo pagado.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div t-if="this.rows.length" class="o_cp_sr_chart mb-3">
                        <svg t-att-viewBox="'0 0 ' + this.chart.width + ' ' + this.chart.height" preserveAspectRatio="none"
                             role="img" aria-label="Curva S">
                            <t t-foreach="this.yTicks" t-as="tick" t-key="tick_index">
                                <line class="o_cp_grid" t-att-x1="this.chart.left" t-att-x2="this.chart.width - this.chart.right"
                                      t-att-y1="tick.y" t-att-y2="tick.y"/>
                                <text class="o_cp_axis" t-att-x="this.chart.left - 6" t-att-y="tick.y + 4"
                                      text-anchor="end" t-out="tick.label"/>
                            </t>
                            <t t-foreach="this.xTicks" t-as="tick" t-key="tick_index">
                                <text class="o_cp_axis" t-att-x="tick.x" t-att-y="this.chart.height - 8"
                                      text-anchor="middle" t-out="tick.label"/>
                            </t>
                            <line t-if="this.todayX" class="o_cp_today" t-att-x1="this.todayX" t-att-x2="this.todayX"
                                  t-att-y1="this.chart.top" t-att-y2="this.chart.height - this.chart.bottom"/>
                            <t t-foreach="this.series" t-as="serie" t-key="serie_index">
                                <polyline t-if="serie.points" t-att-class="'o_cp_serie ' + serie.css + (serie.dashed ? ' o_cp_dashed' : '')"
                                          t-att-points="serie.points"/>
                            </t>
                        </svg>
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small text-muted">
                            <t t-foreach="this.series" t-as="serie" t-key="serie_index">
                                <span><span t-att-class="'o_cp_legend ' + serie.css + (serie.dashed ? ' o_cp_dashed' : '')"/>
                                    <t t-out="serie.label"/></span>
                            </t>
                            <span><span class="o_cp_legend o_cp_today"/>Semana actual</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <table class="table table-sm table-hover o_cp_sr_table align-middle">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Semana</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Costo</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Costo acum.</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Ingreso devengado</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Ingreso acum.</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Margen acum.</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Valorización confirmada</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Facturado</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Cobrado</th>
                                <th class="text-end">Cobrado acum.</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <t t-foreach="this.rows" t-as="row" t-key="row.week_start">
                                <t t-set="data" t-value="row[this.state.scenario]"/>
                                <tr t-att-class="this.isTodayWeek(row) ? 'o_cp_sr_today' : ''">
                                    <td class="text-nowrap" t-out="row.label"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.money(data.cost)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.moneyAlways(data.cost_cum)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.money(data.revenue)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.moneyAlways(data.revenue_cum)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-att-class="data.margin_cum &lt; 0 ? 'text-danger' : ''"
                                        t-out="this.moneyAlways(data.margin_cum)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.money(data.valuation)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.money(data.invoice)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.money(data.collection)"/>
                                    <td class="text-end" t-out="this.moneyAlways(data.collection_cum)"/>
                                </tr>
                            </t>
                        </tbody>
                        <tfoot t-if="this.totals.guarantee">
                            <tr class="fw-bold">
                                <td colspan="8">Fondo de garantía, al cierre</td>
                                <td class="text-end" t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.guarantee)"/>
                                <td class="text-end" t-out="this.moneyAlways(this.totals.collection_total)"/>
                            </tr>
                        </tfoot>
                    </table>
                    <p class="text-muted small">
                        Plan: cada línea del plan repartida en los días hábiles de su etapa; ingreso = precio de la
                        partida × su avance previsto, con material; valorización, factura y cobro según el calendario
                        de la obra. Real: lo ejecutado valorizado (avances validados, horas y consumos), entregas
                        confirmadas, valorizaciones confirmadas, facturas publicadas y cobros conciliados, sin IGV.
                        La última semana del plan absorbe el redondeo.
                    </p>
                </t>
            </div>
        </div>
    </t>

</templates>
